                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Mindware's best classic remake yet. Sort of a PacMan CE DX-style 5-minute time attack, but high scores are based more on careful planning and landing a big payout in the final seconds rather than the constant \"in the zone\" type scoring of Pac. Great music and audio queues. \nIt's been updated really frequently since release, lots of bug fixes and tweaks for the better.\nI do find a lot of the default effects to be overwhelming, but you have a ton of control over that and can turn them up or down to your liking. Definitely keep in mind you can turn the starting level up to 15, once you get the hang of things.",
